<article class="legal-page page-section"><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS PREVIEW</span><h1>Your data, explained.</h1><p>This is an isolated development preview of WanderLust. It is not a commercial hotel booking service.</p><h2>What the app stores</h2><p>Accounts store your username, email address, and a salted password hash. Demo reservations store dates, guest and room counts, contact details, and a snapshot of the selected property and indicative price. Reviews store your comment, rating, and account reference.</p><h2>Sessions and saved stays</h2><p>A session cookie keeps you logged in. Saved stays and your theme preference are stored in this browser. Session records expire automatically. Browser preferences can be removed through your browser settings.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Cloudinary hosts uploaded listing photos. Stock photographs, fonts, scripts, and map tiles are loaded from external providers. Location searches use OpenStreetMap Nominatim. Visiting these resources sends ordinary network requests to those providers.</p><h2>Catalog information</h2><p>Property names and destinations come from official directories. Catalog prices and capacities are demo values, photographs are illustrative, and map coordinates are approximate destination locations. Official property pages are linked for current information.</p><a href="/listings" class="button button-outline">Back to exploring</a></article>
